xt  at the head of the line of the 1b group  essential workers  front line workers first responders  other vulnerable communities so  this is this is still a very satisfied  but let's all understand this is really  complex  and there's a lot of complexity still in  front of us  so what kind of resources could you use  to make the process a little smoother i  know you say that you're satisfied but  are there any additional resources  that you could use to ensure that people  in your state  have the vaccine when necessary yes  satisfied with the guidance  not yet satisfied with the resources we  need a lot more help  and i'm happy congress looks like  they're going to vote on this stimulus  bill  we'll take it we'll put it to good use  but it's a fraction of what we need  this is a this is a once in a century if  not  less frequent moment we need to meet  this moment  in size this does not pass that test  we'll take it  but we need a lot of federal help but  we're not alone this is every state  blue red every american state needs a  big jolt of  stimulus and help from the feds whether  it's administering vaccine  helping us with our budgets to keep  people employed uh small businesses  unemployed you name it  governor you've heard us reporting on  this new uh strain limitation of the  coronavirus vaccine that's been detected  in the united kingdom  new york governor andrew cuomo is asking  and calling on the federal government to  possibly  ban all air travel coming in from the uk  do you support a measure like that  listen his concerns are rightful based  on what we know we're still  investigating to be honest with you  we've got a bigger plea don't travel i i  frankly don't care where you're  traveling just don't travel  stay home stay small for the holidays  whether it's the uk or frankly any other  american state  the less travel we do right now the  smaller we celebrate and i know that  stinks to hear that  the faster we're gonna dig out of this  governor let me 